{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THIS GAME IS ABOUT BEING A DEADLY NINJA ASSASSIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a lethal combination of grappling, martial arts and esoteric ninjutsu techniques to complete your mission and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/CoolMoves-360p.gif?t=1744753645\" />(He's going to need glasses!)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HIGHLY INTERACTIVE NPCS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Target different body parts to inflict pain in amazingly sadistic ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/Arrows-360p.gif?t=1744753645\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes that's real pain he's feeling!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">USE SPEED AND STEALTH TO AVOID BEING OVERWHELMED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies call for help and work together when alerted. Sow chaos to open up a path to your target.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/BridgeKick-360p.gif?t=1744753645\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MAKE FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring NPCs back to your hideout to build up your gang.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/MakeFriends-360p.gif?t=1744753645\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then your real life friend can play as them!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/MakeFriendsPart2-360p.gif?t=1744753645\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TONS OF ITEMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...with multiple uses! Disarm any enemy and use their weapon against them.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/Banana-360p.gif?t=1744753645\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DISCLAIMER:\u00a0<i>Bananas were officially introduced to Japan in <strong>1903</strong>, when they started being imported from Taiwan. However, it's believed that the first banana ever brought to Japan was presented to the warrior Nobunaga Oda by a Portuguese missionary.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Isn't it fascinating how such a common fruit has such a rich history?</i> \ud83c\udf4c</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MASTER TECHNIQUES ONLY REAL NINJAS ARE CAPABLE OF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/CoolCatch-360p.gif?t=1744753645\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634550?t=1744753645","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634550?t=1744753645","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/456a9ca7c7bfe023842654854f21bf574a224db0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744753645","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/456a9ca7c7bfe023842654854f21bf574a224db0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744753645","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Features blood, death and a nude man in a non-sexual context."},"demos":[{"appid":3651460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THIS GAME IS ABOUT BEING A DEADLY NINJA ASSASSIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a lethal combination of grappling, martial arts and esoteric ninjutsu techniques to complete your mission and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c